<title>USA: Barnes &amp; Noble chairman/CEO buys shrs.</title>
<headline>Barnes &amp; Noble chairman/CEO buys shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barnes &amp; Noble Inc said Monday that Chairman and Chief Executive Leonard Riggio has purchased 1.2 million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Riggio purchased the shares from Vendex International NV in a private transaction at $34 per share, the company said.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said that prior to the transaction, Riggio owned or controlled about 6.5 million shares, and Vendex owned about 3.1 million shares.</p>
</text>
